{"about_the_game":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595900/extras/steam-wishlist.gif?t=1744565545\" /><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you are like me, feeling stressful with study buddy, but enjoying working on the transport. This is something for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imagine a Pomodoro Technique at the bottom of your screen. Listen to the whistle sound, rail white noise, lofi music. Drill into this comfortable environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Today is the day, let's start your study journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595900/extras/ezgif-51341237364e84.gif?t=1744565545\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Description / Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Study tools using Pomodoro Technique to help you study</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can treat the game as a Pomodoro Technique, and study / work / play during those duration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- A story behind as a reward</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players joined a charity learning marathon, enable someone to travel through Japan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Decorate your own train room</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Players can have decoration in their train, also they can adjust different music, weather, time and season, to have a comfortable travel journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Minimize mode which can be dragged to anywhere</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595900/extras/ezgif-590116841a9da9.gif?t=1744565545\" /><br><br><br><br>FURTHERMORE<br><br>This game is completed, but we want to further improve it if we have resources:<br>- A chart to show the learning time span in the past week. (&gt;1000 copies)<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595900/extras/chart.png?t=1744565545\" /><br><br>- Watch the train from outside (&gt;5000 copies)<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595900/extras/Outside.jpg?t=1744565545\" /><br><br>Once again, these two features are something we want to see in future, not contain in the current product.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595900/extras/steam-wishlist.gif?t=1744565545\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595900?t=1744565545","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3595900?t=1744565545","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595900/f1da6510ba2395ac0333ecbad3a937849407c435/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744565545","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595900/f1da6510ba2395ac0333ecbad3a937849407c435/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744565545","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3595900/extras/steam-wishlist.gif?t=1744565545\" /><br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you are like me, feeling stressful with study buddy, but enjoying working on the transport. This is something for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Imagine a Pomodoro Technique at the bottom of your screen. Listen to the whistle sound, rail white noise, lofi music. Drill into this c